  "html": "<table align=\"right\" cellpadding=\"2\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"text-align:left; background:rgb(240,240,240); border:1px solid black; width:25%;\">\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"2\" style=\"text-align:center; background:#9999FF; font-size:150%;\"> Retribution\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"2\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a class=\"image\" href=\"/images/recovered/Retribution.png\" title=\"Image:Retribution.jpg\"><img alt=\"Image:Retribution.jpg\" border=\"0\" height=\"43\" src=\"/images/recovered/Retribution.png\" width=\"43\"/></a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"2\"><hr/>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width:50%;\"><b>Skill Type: </b>\n</td><td style=\"width:50%;\">Self Buff\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width:50%;\"><b>Trainer: </b>\n</td><td style=\"width:50%;\">Fighter\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width:50%;\"><b>Number of Ranks: </b>\n</td><td style=\"width:50%;\">5\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width:50%;\"><b>Cost to Max: </b>\n</td><td style=\"width:50%;\">?\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"2\"><hr/>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"2\">Reflects Melee Damage\n</td></tr></table>\n<p>As the name implies, this is more of a \"pay back\" than it is a true <a class=\"missing\" href=\"/wiki/Reflection\" title=\"Reflection\">reflection.</a><br/>\nThis skill has no damage reduction effects and applies to melee damage only.<br/>\nThe full extent of the melee damage is applied to the player, but the melee attacker will also be hit back for a percentage of the damage they inflicted upon the player.  \n</p><p>This skill is particularly against heavy melee hitting monsters such as <a class=\"missing\" href=\"/wiki/The_Shadow_Queen\" title=\"The Shadow Queen\">The Shadow Queen</a> or <a href=\"/wiki/Abaddon\" title=\"Abaddon\">Abby</a>.\n</p><p>Note: In <a href=\"/wiki/PvP\" title=\"PvP\">PvP</a>, the effectiveness of reflection in general is reduced.\n</p><p><b>Cool Down:</b> varies\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><b>The attacker gets hit back for X % of the melee damage inflicted. This aura lasts 30 seconds.</b><br/>\n</p>\n<table align=\"left\" border=\"1\" cellpadding=\"2\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"text-align:center; width:100%; background:rgb(240,240,240);\">\n<tr>\n<td style=\"background:#9999FF\" width=\"5%\">Skill Level\n</td><td style=\"background:#9999FF\">1\n</td><td style=\"background:#9999FF\">2\n</td><td style=\"background:#9999FF\">3\n</td><td style=\"background:#9999FF\">4\n</td><td style=\"background:#9999FF\">5\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"background:#9999FF\" width=\"5%\">Req Char Lvl\n</td><td> 11\n</td><td> 33\n</td><td> 55\n</td><td> 77\n</td><td> 99\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"background:#9999FF\" width=\"5%\">X\n</td><td> 30\n</td><td> 50\n</td><td> 70\n</td><td> 90\n</td><td> 110\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"background:#9999FF\" width=\"5%\">Mana\n</td><td> 30\n</td><td> 75\n</td><td> 112.7\n</td><td> 154.1\n</td><td> 195.4\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"background:#9999FF\" width=\"5%\">Cool Down<br/>(Seconds)\n</td><td> 60\n</td><td> 57\n</td><td> --\n</td><td> --\n</td><td> 45\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"background:#9999FF\" width=\"5%\">Upgrade Cost\n</td><td> 12249\n</td><td> 36749\n</td><td> --\n</td><td> --\n</td><td> --\n</td></tr>\n</table>\n\n \n<div class=\"visualClear\"></div>"
